======================================================================================================================
  [PASS] V1 the independent CSV parse reproduces g05's class sizes exactly (classical 11, M31 34, isolated 5, ultra-faint 29), so the sample selection is not where any disagreement lives   (classical 11, m31 34, isolated 5, ultrafaint 29)
