  alt        a_0=1.13e-10:  N_pressure=14 matched, 36 dropped, N_rotating=147;  pressure median +0.0571 (sd 0.255), rotating median -0.0081 (sd 0.156);  separation +0.0652 dex, 0.94 sigma, perm p = 0.1049
  [PASS] V2 (g05's ARITHMETIC IS CLEAN) recomputed from the raw catalogues with different physical constants, a different quadrature and an independent parse, every headline number of g05 reproduces: +0.064 dex, 0.93 sigma, N = 14 matched / 36 dropped against 147 rotating, rotating control on zero, and the alt footing at +0.065 / 0.94.  There is no arithmetic defect in the estimator   (canonical +0.0644 dex / 0.93 sigma / p=0.1086 against g05's +0.064 / 0.93 / 0.1033;  alt +0.0652 / 0.94 against g05's +0.065 / 0.94;  rotating control -0.0068 (sd 0.156) against g05's -0.007 (0.156))

